        }
      }
    },
    "Amaterasu needs Serato DJ Pro 4. Once Serato is installed and has been opened once, this updates automatically." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Amaterasu 需搭配 Serato DJ Pro 4 使用。安裝並首次開啟 Serato 後，此處狀態將自動更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Amaterasu only reads Serato's database. It never changes it and never uploads anything." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Amaterasu 僅以唯讀方式存取 Serato 資料庫，不會修改其內容，亦不會上傳任何資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anything past the yellow threshold is grey. Half / double time is taken into account (e.g. 70 ↔ 140)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "超出黃色門檻者以灰色顯示。計算時會納入半速 / 倍速（例如 70 ↔ 140）。"
