    "Can't read Serato's database (%@). If Serato was just opened or updated, it may still be preparing its library: wait a moment, then click “Check Again”. If it still can't be read, check the file permissions, or add Amaterasu under System Settings › Privacy & Security › Full Disk Access." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無法讀取 Serato 資料庫（%@）。若 Serato 剛開啟或剛完成更新，可能仍在準備曲庫，請稍候再按「重新檢查」。若仍無法讀取，請確認檔案權限，或至「系統設定 › 隱私權與安全性 › 完整磁碟取用權限」加入 Amaterasu。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
