    },
    "On external displays and Macs without a notch, the panel appears as a capsule at the top centre of the screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在外接顯示器或沒有瀏海的 Mac 上，面板會以膠囊形狀顯示於螢幕頂端中央。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once Serato DJ Pro is open, the panel shows the loaded tracks automatically. If Serato is already open but this still says Not running (for example, right after an update or a slow launch), click “Check Again”." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟 Serato DJ Pro 後，面板將自動顯示已載入的曲目。若 Serato 已開啟但仍顯示「未執行」（例如剛完成更新或啟動較慢），請按「重新檢查」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once you've played tracks in Serato, each session's tempo curve and tracklist show up here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Serato 播放曲目後，各場次的速度曲線與曲目清單將顯示於此。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
